{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f5accc12c92aa12b7cb4663cb8dc9aaddc00e989becc2769714464997747380f", "ja": "（エミリーが、バラエティ番組の企画で、\n寿司職人に弟子入りすることになった）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉要在综艺节目的企划中，\n向寿司师傅拜师学艺。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "bcfd5e8020ba64dbd66dbdca7f50d34bd8b9f29f8bf7ed05dc2c8648b5b98dcb", "ja": "Wow！　とても光栄です。\nでも、私に務まるでしょうか……？", "zh": "Wow！我觉得非常光荣。\n但是我能够顺利达成吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_1003_p", "source_sha256": "16c99acad2c3736f22dd854dbf7ceea6c2e5b981ec9bdea8b556c21555845fa9", "ja": "不安もあるだろうけど、日本の文化に触れる\nいい機会だと思うよ。勉強させてもらうといい。", "zh": "我想你可能也会感到不安，但这是接触\n日本文化的好机会喔，好好学习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8f3e1215f4e6f5faebf55dfcc36b2026e122565d533f72739b8dacfd5d7830b", "ja": "そうですね。お寿司が握れるようになれば、\nまた一歩、大和撫子に近づけますし……。", "zh": "没错，如果学会捏寿司，\n就能再朝大和抚子接近一步了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b1f61a6784c31842b113c148e33c5da87940313427e126cf68d999fbd1e5299", "ja": "仕掛け人さま。私、精いっぱい頑張って、\n立派な寿司職人になりますね！", "zh": "策划执行人先生，我会尽全力加油，\n成为出色的寿司师傅的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_1006_p", "source_sha256": "beba69337dd5735cb9b3d5ff2943f8aa583b4a5ed1b8b28f61324521b529f4fd", "ja": "いや、寿司職人になられると困るが……。\nとにかく頑張ろう！", "zh": "不，你要是成为寿司师傅，我会很为难的……\n但总之就加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
